<title>BERMUDA: LaSalle re sees NYSE listing on April 11.</title>
<headline>LaSalle re sees NYSE listing on April 11.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaSalle Re Holdings Ltd on Tuesday said it expects its common stock to be listed on the New York Stock Exchange on April 1.</p>
<p>The trading symbol will be &quot;LSH.&quot;</p>
<p>The stock is currently listed on the Nasdaq.</p>
<p>LaSalle Re Holdings Ltd, through its subsidiary, LaSalle Re Ltd, writes high severity, low frequency reinsurance, primarily property catastrophe reinsurance, the firm said.</p>
</text>
